  "diagnosis": {
    "connection_updates": "Default-idle connection rendering was delayed behind GTK background text validation. A debugger observed GTK/Pango/HarfBuzz on the main thread after the insertion had completed. Schedule the existing coalesced one-shot update after visible paint and before background validation using GTK_TEXT_VIEW_PRIORITY_VALIDATE - 1.",
