      "silent_renderer_failure_explained_false",
      "silent_renderer_failure_explained_true",
      "silent_renderer_open_finishes_false",
      "silent_renderer_open_finishes_true",
      "timeout_preserves_reader_and_notes"
    ],
    "startup_recovery": "A 30-second deadline after staging reflow restores the previous reader/notes or shows a cold-open error. Existing commit/discard lifecycle cancels the timer; source identity rejects stale completions.",
    "historical_stalls": "Not reproduced in 100 subsequent launches. Original cause remains unproven. The renderer deadline addresses a demonstrated indefinite-wait failure mode, not a proven cause of those historical stalls; a blocked native main thread or graphics-driver hang remains outside its reach.",
    "extreme_paragraphs": "A bare GTK TextView independently reproduces long single-paragraph layout cost. Insertion, caret relocation, and save/layout are now measured separately. Native layout cost remains; no editor replacement or hidden text splitting was added."
  },
